---@field description? string Optional. A description of the pool. Cannot exceed 256 characters.
---@field displayName? string Optional. A display name for the pool. Cannot exceed 32 characters.
---@field state? gcp.unstable.iam_v1.WorkforcePoolStateEnum Output only. The state of the pool.
---@field disabled? boolean Optional. Disables the workforce pool. You cannot use a disabled pool to exchange tokens, or use existing tokens to access resources. If the pool is re-enabled, existing tokens grant access again.
---@field accessRestrictions? gcp.unstable.iam_v1.AccessRestrictions Optional. Configure access restrictions on the workforce pool users. This is an optional field. If specified web sign-in can be restricted to given set of services or programmatic sign-in can be disabled for pool users.
